{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>My lord.</b> And not 'our lord' — singular of address. And it is not the way of Scripture to set any others as partners with Him." "<b>A prince of Elohim.</b> A way of greatness, because you are a prophet." "<b>Let him not.</b> Let him not withhold, for it is found with heh also with alef at the end,"], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:45:29.452851755Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}